cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "SPY-C"
abstract: >-
  SPY-C is a process-based crop model that couples SpaFHy (canopy and soil
  water balance), Phydro (plant hydraulics and photosynthesis) and Yasso
  (soil carbon), together with crop phenology and carbon allocation.
